{"asset_key":"ep8/quest_story_18260440","episode":"ep8","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18260440","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1826044001:1":{"text":"貴方がセレネ嬢ですね。噂に違わず、実に優雅で人を惹きつけるお方だ。多くの歌劇ファンがこぞって貴方を慕うのもうなずける……","source_cn":"想必你一定就是塞涅小姐。果然和传闻中一样，优雅动人，令...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4176DE825BFC03DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1826044002:0":{"text":"初めまして……領主様のお客人ですか？","source_cn":"你好。你是领主阁下的客人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0CE5DD9763320A56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1826044003:1":{"text":"子爵のスレーザーと申します。\nセレネ嬢にお目にかかれて光栄です。","source_cn":"——斯莱泽子爵。\\n很高兴认识你，塞涅小姐。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16C4731D070888C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1826044004:1":{"text":"子爵……ということは、バンティスのグレイヴボーンですね。","source_cn":"子爵……那么，你是班题斯的亡灵。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2BCCCCEECA5B721","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1826044005:1":{"text":"僭越ながら申し上げておきますが、貴方も今はバンティスのグレイヴボーンですよ。","source_cn":"请容我提醒你，塞涅小姐，你现在也是班题斯的亡灵。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5870C5C468990F05","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1826044006:1":{"text":"テペシュ様とはずいぶん親しい間柄だとか。あなたの公演には、毎回欠かさず足を運んでいたそうですね。ですが、この貴賓席の埃を見るに……<style=\"highlight\">もしや、しばらくこちらにはいらしていないのでは</style>？","source_cn":"听闻苔佩希小姐与你素来要好，你的每场演出她必定到场。但...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x15ECD900C2E49961","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1826044007:1":{"text":"ここ最近は公演を行っていないので、掃除が行き届いていなかっただけですわ。","source_cn":"最近海歌剧院没有演出安排，只是疏于打扫。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB94031CF4F681EF5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1826044008:1":{"text":"教えていただき、ありがとうございます。次の公演までに、貴賓席のクッションとテーブルクロスを新しいものに替えさせておきます。","source_cn":"感谢你的提醒。下次演出前，我会请工作人员为贵宾席更换坐...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBED1AF0BFE2ACEB5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1826044009:1":{"text":"ええ、それがよろしいでしょう。かの御方に失礼があってはなりませんからね。","source_cn":"当然，当然。你们可不能怠慢了尊贵的苔佩希小姐。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B9B302C6D581661","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1826044010:1":{"text":"テペシュ様を怒らせれば、この劇場など跡形もなく消し飛びかねませんよ。","source_cn":"否则一旦惹怒了她，说不准……连海歌剧院都会被她夷为平地。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C188B7BA303402A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1826044011:1":{"text":"……領主様が、そんなことをなさるはずありません。","source_cn":"……领主阁下不会那么做。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB12F3FAA84296FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1826044012:1":{"text":"ははっ、今のはただの冗談ですよ。","source_cn":"我知道，只是开个玩笑。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x42015C47806FE59D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1826044013:1":{"text":"私がいたずらに不安を煽っているなどとは思わないでくださいね。それでは、これにて失礼。","source_cn":"塞涅小姐，还请不要误会我是在危言耸听。打搅了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE31CEA77344422CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1826044014:1":{"text":"……ええ、さようなら。","source_cn":"……再见。<key:dialog88>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0DD4D728EA0E6AA4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:17:1826044015:1":{"text":"ズイスはスレーザーの行動を事細かく報告した。","source_cn":"","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4ED96508866C2C31","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"ズイスはスレーザーの行動を事細かく報告した。","female":"ズイスはスレーザーの行動を事細かく報告した。","variant_male_record_index":"251248","variant_female_record_index":"251249","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","docu